Conversation History
Definition

Conversation History means saving all previous messages between the user and the chatbot during the conversation.

Example

User:

Show Chennai news.

AI:

Heavy rain is expected in Chennai today.

User:

Summarize it.

The AI looks at the conversation history and knows that "it" refers to the Chennai news.

Simple Definition

Conversation History is the record of all previous messages exchanged between the user and the AI.
